# WizardUseSkill's party attacked hook as the reference groups it: a leader (20216, Party_Type
# 2) whose third skill (a buff, Skill03_Type 3) aims at itself (Skill03_Target 3), raised with
# a private (21039, Party_Type 1) the leader is master of. A call from anyone but the leader's
# own master picks the calling member whatever the skill's target says, so the hit private
# makes the leader want the buff on that private at 1000000000, and not on itself.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.MonsterBehavior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.WizardBehavior.WizardBehavior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.WizardBehavior.WizardUseSkill.WizardUseSkill
npc leader 20216 Monster 400 0 0 ai Party_Type=2,Skill03_Target=3,Skill03_Type=3 skill SKILL03_ID 1068 1
npc private 21039 Monster 400 100 0 master leader ai Party_Type=1,Party_Loyalty=2

hit private 10
  master private leader
  privates leader 21039=1
  desires leader cast(private,1068,move)=1000000000
